   "text": "✎ 261009 the view reads the cooked CaseSet when one is mounted ($INLAB_CASE_STORE: df_case + one parquet per CaseFn, row for row); no table, column or CaseFn is named in the code",
   "originalText": "✎ 261009 the view reads the cooked CaseSet when one is mounted ($INLAB_CASE_STORE: df_case + one parquet per CaseFn, row for row); no table, column or CaseFn is named in the code",
